        "In this photograph Y3nnefer sits on a wooden chair in a dimly lit rustic room. She wears a black off-the-shoulder corset adorned with teal feathers and lace paired with thigh-high brown leather boots. Her expression is pensive with slightly parted lips and a focused gaze directed to the left. A black choker with a circular pendant rests around her neck. The background features a wooden table with a green plant and an open book and the wall is adorned with dried plants and a small window. The camera perspective is slightly low emphasizing her seated position and the texture of her clothing. Soft warm lighting highlights her features and the details of her outfit creating a moody atmospheric effect. <lora:Krea2Y3nnefer:1>"
